Usage: agent-deck accounts [--harness claude|codex] [--json]

List named account slots configured as [profiles.<name>.claude].config_dir
(or [profiles.<name>.codex].config_dir with --harness codex).

These names are the valid values for `launch --account`, `session set <id>
account` and `session switch-account`, and for the account row in the TUI's
New Session and Edit Session dialogs.

  -harness string
    	Harness family whose slots to list: claude ([profiles.<name>.claude].config_dir) or codex ([profiles.<name>.codex].config_dir) (default "claude")
  -json
    	Output as JSON
